# This repository is not formatted by Prettier.
#
# Prettier has no tracked invocation here: it is absent from
# `.pre-commit-config.yaml` and from every gate suite, so it never runs in CI.
# It reaches files only through an agent editor hook outside this repository,
# where it reformatted 596 of 776 Markdown files -- realigning every table and
# rewriting frontmatter quoting -- against conventions this repository's own
# templates and validators encode.
#
# Each file type already has one owner:
#   *.md            markdownlint-cli2 plus the Stage 99 document validators
#   *.yaml, *.yml   yamllint, and actionlint for workflows
#   *.json          check-json
#   *.py            ruff format, pinned by ruff.toml
#   *.sh            shellcheck
#   Dockerfile*     hadolint
#   *.ts, *.tsx     eslint, run by the frontend-lint gate on the Next.js
#   *.js, *.jsx     project; no other JavaScript is tracked here
#
# One type has no owner: `examples/sample-web-service/site/index.html`. Prettier
# was the only tool that reached it, so removing Prettier left it unformatted
# rather than reformatted by something else. Give HTML an owner before adding
# more of it.
#
# Ignoring everything keeps that ownership single. Narrow this file only
# together with a tracked Prettier invocation that says what it owns.
*
